# Expanded Implementation Plan: Interactive Fault & Stress Scenario Controls

Based on your feedback, we have expanded the **Interactive Grid Stress Controls** to include **6 realistic, high-impact grid stress scenarios** covering physics guardrails, TANGEDCO agricultural subsidies, EV rush hours, and severe weather events.

---

